{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>For am I in the place of Elohim.</b> For my heart was broken and I feared Elohim — התחת here means כאל תחת ('as if in place of')."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 50, :notes {0 "The note quotes an Aramaic Targum-style paraphrase (כי נשבר לבי וירא אלהים) and then glosses the word התחת as meaning 'in place of' (אל תחת), reading it as 'as if in place of.'"}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:07:33.610395713Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}